  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Southern Border, Chai Po Jun intercepts Bai Ning Bing after the group is scattered, and she reads the method on his skin as Neutralize Wood Body, created by him. While pondering that skin, she judges that an immortal killer move that is not powerful enough has its strength sharply reduced to mortal killer move level when it strikes this body. The unique move directly destroys her cold eyes immortal killer move and can disregard cold eyes. Bai Xiang’s true inheritance is not only cold eyes, so Chai Po Jun still takes injuries in the fight.",
